#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look at the floor, a little ahead of your hands."
msgstr "{crew|Olha|Olha|Olhem} para o chão, um pouco à frente das mãos."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Stretch one arm forward and the opposite leg back."
