#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the Ottoman Empire, a kadı judged by the law, and the people could bring a complaint even "
"against a powerful aga."
