"{crew|Capitão|Capitã|Capitães|Capitãs}, o Conde vende «amuletos do vento» aos pescadores desta "
"costa."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He says that without his charm, no boat gets a good wind!"
msgstr "Diz que, sem o amuleto dele, nenhum barco tem bom vento!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me three charms, from Rimini, Fano and Ancona. Let us see what is inside."
msgstr "Tragam-me três amuletos, de Rimini, Fano e Ancona. Vamos ver o que têm dentro."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here, take my charm. Three ducats, and still no wind!"
msgstr "Tomem, levem o meu amuleto. Três ducados, e vento nenhum!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is only a little bottle with a cork."
msgstr "É só uma garrafinha com uma rolha."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "My husband paid two ducats for this charm."
msgstr "O meu marido pagou dois ducados por este amuleto."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Shake it: nothing inside! Take it."
msgstr "Abanem-no: não tem nada lá dentro! Levem-no."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count's men sold it to me on the pier."
msgstr "Os homens do Conde venderam-mo no cais."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/17_wind_seller/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
